sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant RecipeImport as RecipeImport
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+RecipeImport: recordResolutionProgress(resolvedLineCount)
    Note over RecipeImport: Policies: recipeImportRead, recipeImportWrite, recipeImportExecute
    Note over RecipeImport: Guards (3)
    RecipeImport->>RecipeImport: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;reviewing#quot;
    RecipeImport->>RecipeImport: guard[1]: self.reviewStartedAt != null
    RecipeImport->>RecipeImport: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    RecipeImport->>RecipeImport: mutate.resolvedLineCount
    RecipeImport->>EventBus: emit RecipeImportResolutionProgressRecorded on recipe_import.resolution_progress_recorded
    RecipeImport-->>-Client: void